<title>RUSSIA: Russia plans $3.5 bln Eurobonds in 98--govt source.</title>
<headline>Russia plans $3.5 bln Eurobonds in 98--govt source.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's finance ministry will propose to a cabinet meeting on Thursday issuing $3.5 billion of Eurobonds in 1998, a senior government source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We intend to take about $3.5 billion through Eurobonds,&quot; the source said.</p>
</text>
